message: 'To cite package "abmAnimalMovement" in publications use:'
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
title: 'abmAnimalMovement: An R Package for Simulating Animal Movement Using an Agent-Based
  Model'
version: 0.1.4.0000
doi: 10.12688/f1000research.124810.1
abstract: The *abmAnimalMovement* simulates animal movement use a discrete time agent-based
  model, programmed in C++ via the Rcpp package. The simulations include a number
  of key internal and external movement influences, as well as parameters for navigation
  and mobility capacity of the animal.
